+/*
+ * The pinned SPL only reaches MMC0 after the CCU clock/gate/reset words
+ * (+0x830, +0x84c with readback) and the PF0..PF5 function-2 pinmux at the
+ * legacy-stride PIO cells; program the same sequence before register
+ * access.
